
# Input group — headless. Wraps an input with addons (prefix/suffix). Parts: input-group, input-group-addon.
load @term/site/code/zone/render
  find element
load @term/site/code/dom/dom
  find view
  find append

zone input-group
  take host, like view
  take class
  zone div
    bind data-slot, text <input-group>
    bind class, read class
    site

zone input-group-addon
  take host, like view
  take class
  zone div
    bind data-slot, text <input-group-addon>
    bind class, read class
    site
